<title>PORTUGAL: WestLB Finance launches 10 bln esc, 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB Finance launches 10 bln esc, 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager and book-runner Banco Finantia:</p>
<p>BORROWER WestLB Finance Curacao AMT 10 billion escudos</p>
<p>COUPON 6.8 percent MATURITY Five years</p>
<p>    TYPE Bullet	  ISS PRICE 101.626</p>
<p>    LAST MOODY Aa1     LAST S&amp;P AA+</p>
<p>FULL COMMISSIONS 2.0 percent</p>
<p>Banco Finantia said in a statement that the issue was guaranteed by Westdeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale. A syndicate is being formed.</p>
<p>The issue is calculated to give a a yield equivalent to the five-year Portuguese Treasury bond (OT) plus four basis points.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
